/mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtext>SD</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.29</mn><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
